{
  "slug": "reef",
  "name": "Reef",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Structured knowledge wiki generator for codebases. Auto-discovers services, APIs, schemas, and cross-system contracts, then deepens through guided Q&A. Obsidian-native, local-first.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 skills** and **1 agent**.\n\n- **Skills** (12): `artifact` (Explore a topic, capture knowledge, or update an artifact), `deep` (Exhaustive line-by-line tracing of critical areas), `feed` (Scan for new context files and connect them to the reef), `health` (Validate artifacts and report freshness), `help` (Show available skills, reef status, and recommended next action), `init` (Bootstrap a new reef wiki from your codebase), `lint` (Lint artifacts for format and structural errors, with auto-fix), `scuba` (Automated knowledge deepening — manifest-driven artifact generation from snorkel+source output), and 4 more\n- **Agents** (1): `reef-navigator` (Use this agent when the user asks a question about their codebase and a reef wiki exists in…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install reef@claude-community` from `eunji-jessi-jung/reef`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 12,
    "agent": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
